# Visit-alert email key (Web3Forms) — powers src/components/VisitNotifier.js
#
# Web3Forms delivers every submission to the email address that OWNS the access
# key. So to have alerts reach francis@creativedevlabs.com, the key below MUST
# be the one created at https://web3forms.com using francis@creativedevlabs.com
# as the registered email. Creating the key with any other address sends the
# alerts to that other inbox instead — the recipient is chosen at key-creation
# time, not in this file.
#
# This NEXT_PUBLIC_ value is embedded into the client bundle and is visible to
# anyone who views the site, which is expected for Web3Forms access keys.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local use, or set the variable in your
# host's environment settings (Netlify / Vercel / Cloudflare Pages). Leave it
# empty and the visit alert does nothing.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
